see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/harness.vox".
see "../src/runner.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".

(The layout randomiser's gate. Two claims, and the second is the one the
 pass exists to be allowed to make:

   1. Layout never changes behaviour. For each seed the same program is
      generated twice, once laid out plainly and once with its whitespace
      drawn, and both are compiled and run with the SAME argv and the
      SAME stdin. Identical stdout, identical verdict, identical exit
      status, or the pass is wrong.
   2. Layout never changes CONTENT. Strip the whitespace out of both
      sources and the remaining bytes are identical - which is what makes
      it honest to say the seed-to-program mapping is untouched, and what
      lets 200_never_emitted scan a plainly laid-out program and still be
      scanning what the campaign runs.

 Claim 2 is not implied by claim 1: a pass that quietly dropped a whole
 statement could still produce two programs that agree on stdout.

 Both runs get the scratch directory the campaign hands every generated
 program, and they SHARE it, exactly as the campaign's own two runs of
 one binary do - a generated program is insensitive to what the previous
 run left there, and that is the property the nondeterminism oracle
 already gates on.)

a number called 'the seeds checked' is 0.
a number called 'the behaviour mismatches' is 0.
a number called 'the content mismatches' is 0.
a number called 'the compile failures' is 0.

(Every space, tab, newline and carriage return removed - the bytes that
 are left are the program's content.)
To 'strip whitespace' with a text called source.
    a buffer called 'the source bytes' is "{source}".
    a buffer called 'the kept bytes'.
    a buffer called 'one byte' is 1 bytes in size.
    a number called 'how many bytes' is 'the source bytes's length.
    a number called i is 1.
    While i is less than or equal to 'how many bytes',
        a number called b is byte i of 'the source bytes',
        a boolean called 'it is blank' is false,
        If b is 32 or b is 9 then,
            Set 'it is blank' to true.
        If b is 10 or b is 13 then,
            Set 'it is blank' to true.
        If 'it is blank' is false then,
            Set byte 1 of 'one byte' to b,
            append 'one byte' to 'the kept bytes'.
        Set i to i add 1.
    a text called 'the content' is 'the kept bytes' as text.
    Return a text, 'the content'.

To 'check one seed' with a number called seed and a number called budget.
    Set 'the seeds checked' to 'the seeds checked' add 1.
    'gen set layout' of "plain".
    'gen program' of seed and budget.
    a text called 'the plain source' is 'gen text'.
    'gen write' of "./vf_layout_plain.vox".
    'gen set layout' of "random".
    'gen program' of seed and budget.
    a text called 'the drawn source' is 'gen text'.
    'gen write' of "./vf_layout_drawn.vox".
    'gen write input' of "./vf_layout_stdin".
    a text called 'the plain content' is 'strip whitespace' of 'the plain source'.
    a text called 'the drawn content' is 'strip whitespace' of 'the drawn source'.
    If 'the plain content' is not 'the drawn content' then,
        Set 'the content mismatches' to 'the content mismatches' add 1.
    (The argv the generator chose for this seed, plus the scratch
     directory, exactly as loop_gen.vox hands them to a live program.)
    a list called 'the arguments' is gen_argv.
    append "--scratch{gen_flags}" to 'the arguments'.
    append "./vf_layout_scratch" to 'the arguments'.
    a number called 'the plain compile' is 'compile vox' of "." and "./vf_layout_plain.vox" and "./vf_layout_plain_bin" and "./vf_layout_plain_cerr".
    a number called 'the drawn compile' is 'compile vox' of "." and "./vf_layout_drawn.vox" and "./vf_layout_drawn_bin" and "./vf_layout_drawn_cerr".
    If 'the plain compile' is not 0 or 'the drawn compile' is not 0 then,
        Set 'the compile failures' to 'the compile failures' add 1,
        Return a number, 0.
    a text called 'the plain verdict' is 'run program capturing with input' of "./vf_layout_plain_bin" and 10000 and "./vf_layout_plain_out" and 'the arguments' and "./vf_layout_stdin".
    a number called 'the plain exit code' is 'exit code of' of 'the last status'.
    a text called 'the drawn verdict' is 'run program capturing with input' of "./vf_layout_drawn_bin" and 10000 and "./vf_layout_drawn_out" and 'the arguments' and "./vf_layout_stdin".
    a number called 'the drawn exit code' is 'exit code of' of 'the last status'.
    a text called 'the plain output' is 'read whole file' of "./vf_layout_plain_out".
    a text called 'the drawn output' is 'read whole file' of "./vf_layout_drawn_out".
    a boolean called 'the two agree' is true.
    If 'the plain verdict' is not 'the drawn verdict' then,
        Set 'the two agree' to false.
    If 'the plain exit code' is not 'the drawn exit code' then,
        Set 'the two agree' to false.
    If 'the plain output' is not 'the drawn output' then,
        Set 'the two agree' to false.
    If 'the two agree' is false then,
        Set 'the behaviour mismatches' to 'the behaviour mismatches' add 1,
        Print "layout changed behaviour at seed {seed}: verdicts {'the plain verdict'}/{'the drawn verdict'} exits {'the plain exit code'}/{'the drawn exit code'}".
    Return a number, 1.

a number called 'the cleanup before' is 'run shell' of "rm -rf ./vf_layout_*" and 5000.
a number called 'the scratch made' is 'make directories' of "./vf_layout_scratch".

a number called 'the seed' is 1000.
While 'the seed' is less than 1032,
    a number called 'the checked' is 'check one seed' of 'the seed' and 12,
    Set 'the seed' to 'the seed' add 1.

Print "seeds checked: {'the seeds checked'}".
Print "both layouts compiled every seed: {'the compile failures' is 0}".
Print "whitespace-stripped sources identical: {'the content mismatches' is 0}".
Print "layout never changed stdout or exit status: {'the behaviour mismatches' is 0}".

a number called 'the cleanup after' is 'run shell' of "rm -rf ./vf_layout_*" and 5000.
